@page "/terms"

<PageTitle>Terms of Service | @AppConfig.AppName</PageTitle>

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8">
    <div class="border-b border-zinc-200 pb-5 mb-8">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 sm:text-3xl">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-600">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-zinc text-sm text-zinc-700 space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
        <section class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p>
                By creating an account, browsing listings, offering to purchase, or listing hardware on @AppConfig.AppName, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900">2. Marketplace Platform &amp; Escrow</h2>
            <p>
                @AppConfig.AppName provides a peer-to-peer hardware transaction platform. All transactions leverage an inspection escrow mechanism. Funds are held securely until the buyer inspects and confirms the hardware condition within the 48-hour inspection window.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900">3. Condition Disclosures &amp; Checklists</h2>
            <p>
                Sellers must truthfully complete the hardware condition checklist, disclosing defects, functional issues, cosmetic condition, serial numbers, and included accessories. Misrepresentation violates platform rules and forfeits escrow release.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900">4. Buyer Inspection Period</h2>
            <p>
                Upon delivery or handoff, buyers have 48 hours to inspect and bench-test the item. If the item differs from the seller's condition checklist, the buyer may raise a dispute before the inspection window expires.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900">5. Dispute Resolution</h2>
            <p>
                Disputes are reviewed by platform administrators with reference to the original checklist and proof photos. Administrator determinations regarding escrow payouts or refunds are binding.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
